[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11222.469, "timestamp": "03:07:02", "text": "我的意思是，如果我这么做的话，那也没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11224.07, "timestamp": "03:07:04", "text": "可能只有少数人会这么做，但如果我这么做的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11226.229, "timestamp": "03:07:06", "text": "对每个人来说，就好像，哦，我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11236.71, "timestamp": "03:07:16", "text": "重新装弹。我走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11238.469, "timestamp": "03:07:18", "text": "如果他们人很好，而且他们愿意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11240.389, "timestamp": "03:07:20", "text": "做朋友吧，我已经见过几个了，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11243.189, "timestamp": "03:07:23", "text": "我知道，我在这里遇到了德拉格诺斯，因为呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11245.75, "timestamp": "03:07:25", "text": "瓦莱兰特。最后一名幸存者。哦，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11248.71, "timestamp": "03:07:28", "text": "在 Valerant 中遇到了 Draos。一个敌人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11250.71, "timestamp": "03:07:30", "text": "其余的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11254.87, "timestamp": "03:07:34", "text": "哦，那真不错。最后一名幸存者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11272.389, "timestamp": "03:07:52", "text": "他打得像个职业选手。"}]